# LF in every text file on every OS: Windows git (core.autocrlf=true) would check out CRLF,
# which breaks engine/env.sh in Git Bash ($'\\r': command not found) and every SKILL.md / JSON parser that splits on \\n
* text=auto eol=lf
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
